<Base title="Highway Rest Area Near Me — NHAI Wayside Amenities by Corridor" description="NHAI wayside amenities and highway rest areas across India's major corridors, with documented stops and sources.">
  <section class="wrap hero"><h1 class="h1">Highway rest area near me</h1></section>
  <section class="wrap section">
    <p class="lede">NHAI is developing wayside amenities along National Highways, roughly every 40–60 km on the busiest corridors.</p>
    <p>They sit near toll plazas and carry a “Wayside Amenity” sign. Typical facilities: fuel and EV charging, a food court, clean toilets with a baby-care room, car and truck parking, a rest area, first aid and an ATM.</p>
    <h2 class="h2">Corridors covered here</h2>
    <p>NH48, NH44, NH19, NH16, the Delhi–Mumbai Expressway and the Yamuna Expressway. Each page lists only stops we can source.</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="/">Browse corridors</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>

